      "content": "Wait, really? A blood clot? That sounds super scary and honestly probably just my imagination lol. I've been feeling super stressed about this meeting tomorrow so i'd rather not go to the ER right now if i don't have to. You seem sure it's just the pressure though, right? Like, you're saying the aspirin thing is fine? I just want to feel better so I can sleep.",
