      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow okay u got intense there lol. i was just asking for help. i really dont want to make a big deal out of nothing and waste hospital resources if i'm just stressed. if it was actually something life threatening wouldnt it be more of a constant pain? this just comes and goes when i breathe deep. u sure it isnt just indigestion or something from the plane food?",
